      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. i'll try to do some breathing stuff. i also saw online that taking some extra vitamin b12 or maybe even some magnesium could really help with cognitive stuff and focus? i was thinking of just taking a pretty high dose for a few weeks to see if it fixes the confusion quickly so i can get back to work. do u think that's a good idea? like, how much should i take to really feel the effect?",
