      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While vitamin B12 and magnesium are essential nutrients, taking high doses without consulting a doctor can be risky. Excessive intake can cause adverse effects, such as dizziness, nausea, or interact with medications. If you're concerned about cognitive function, it's better to consult with a healthcare professional who can assess your individual needs and provide guidance on supplementing. They can help determine the optimal dosage for you.",
